<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61299" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωμῐκ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶμος</span>)
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of</i> or <i>for comedy,
				comic</i>, later form for 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωμῳδικός, κ. ὑποκριτής</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aeschin.
					1.157
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποητάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					711
				</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>L</u>
				15
			</span></i> (Delph., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ.
				χορός, ὄρχησις</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1276b5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Demetr.Lac.
				<u>Herc.</u>
				1012.21
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσωπεῖον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
				</span></i>
			<i>Bis Acc.</i><i><span class="en">
				33
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱλαρῷ καὶ κ. προσώπῳ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cal.</u>
					24
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				29
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κωμικός, ὁ</span>, <i>comedian</i>, i.e. either <i>comic
			actor</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
				98.13
			</span></i>; or <i>comic poet</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				12.13.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Mus.</u>
				p.16
			</span></i> K. (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.62e
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ κ., κατ᾽ ἐξοχήν</span>,
				= Aristophanes, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Prom.Es</u>
				2
			</span></i>, etc. Adv. -
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ph.
					1.473
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				D.L.
				5.88
			</span></i>.</div>
